# Payments

- Amount and fulfillment live on the server (`PaymentIntent`).
- Robokassa ResultURL verifies Password2 signature, responds `OK{InvId}`, then fulfill.
- Success/fail pages only display status. Poll `GET /payments/intents/{id}`.
- `PAYMENT_TEST=true` + empty MerchantLogin → Robokassa demo shop (`auth.robokassa.ru`, `IsTest=1`). Live = env flip, not new endpoints.
- Public chrome: `src/v2`, OLED + `#22C55E`. No client `payment_success=true`.
